  <title>Marjan Increment Project - Package 1</title>
  <link>https://www.dodsalgroup.com/projects/marjan-increment-project-package-1-0</link>
  <description>&lt;span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.dodsalgroup.com/projects/marjan-increment-project-package-1-0" hreflang="en"&gt;Marjan Increment Project - Package 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/span&gt;

      &lt;div class="field field--name-field-project-metrics field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items"&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;2019&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;awarded&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;EPCI&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;of 6 large topsides&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
  


  &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-highlights field--type-text-long field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Highlights&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;Single largest offshore EPCI project awarded by Saudi Aramco in Dodsal Group’s history&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;Landmark project where Dodsal Group transitions from its legacy conventional float over methodology to DP (Dynamic Positioning) for all six large topsides&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;Project execution spread over five fabrication yards&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-project-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;The project comprises an entire offshore GOSP complex including gas compression, production and accommodation topsides. Dodsal Group manages interfaces with several other contractors involved in the Marjan Increment Program.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-solutions-category field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;Pipelines, Cables &amp;amp; Umbilicals&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-spotlight-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;  &lt;img loading="eager" src="https://www.dodsalgroup.com/sites/default/files/styles/webp/public/2024-10/Marjan%20Increment%20Project%201_0.png.webp?itok=TBwA408d" width="864" height="576" alt="Marjan Increment Project - Package 1" class="image-style-webp"&gt;


&lt;/div&gt;
      
