<item>
  <title>North Field Expansion Project</title>
  <link>https://www.dodsalgroup.com/projects/north-field-expansion-project-0</link>
  <description>&lt;span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.dodsalgroup.com/projects/north-field-expansion-project-0" hreflang="en"&gt;North Field Expansion Project&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/span&gt;

      &lt;div class="field field--name-field-project-metrics field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items"&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;300&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;miles of pipelines&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;140 miles&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;of 33kV subsea cables&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;2022&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;awarded *From commercial deck*&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;77 to 126 MTPA&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;increase annual LNG output (1/3 of global production)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
  


  &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-highlights field--type-text-long field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Highlights&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;For the first time, four of the WHT, plus all subsea infrastructure, are being fabricated in the QFAB yard with support from our fabrication yard in Batam, Indonesia&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;The largest single offshore contracts Dodsal Group has been awarded in its history.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-project-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;The project comprises the delivery of wellhead topsides, associated subsea pipelines, and subsea cables. The project also includes an onshore pipeline scope, including a beach valve station, and sensory tower platforms. When complete, the platforms will provide feed gas to the first of six new LNG trains currently under construction in Qatar.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-solutions-category field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;Pipelines, Cables &amp;amp; Umbilicals&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-spotlight-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;  &lt;img loading="eager" src="https://www.dodsalgroup.com/sites/default/files/styles/webp/public/2024-11/North%20Field%20Expansion%20Spotlight_0.jpg.webp?itok=oVuLo3tY" width="864" height="576" alt="North Field Expansion Project (NFXP)" class="image-style-webp"&gt;


&lt;/div&gt;
      
  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-location field--type-string field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Location&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;Offshore Qatar&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-scope field--type-string field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Scope&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;Fabrication &amp;amp; Installation&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
</description>
